### Custom Upload Paths

If you have your own **Alibaba Cloud** or **AWS** cloud service, you can transfer images directly to your **personal cloud storage bucket** by setting a customized upload path.

<figure><img src="../../img/assets/qc upload custom.png" alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure>

