1.  **Select cloud service type**

    1. Choose between **ALICLOUD.CUSTOM** or **AWS.CUSTOM**. ![](<../../img/assets/qc upload custom info alicloud.png>)
    2. Set the **region** to **OWNER**.       &#x20;

    &#x20; ![](<../../img/assets/qc upload custom info aws.png>)
2. **Enter required details**
   * Remote path
   * KeyID & password
   * S3 bucket name
